{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10443","headline":"留别郑三韦九兼洛下诸公 · 高适","name":"留别郑三韦九兼洛下诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨相逢论久要，顾君哂我轻常调。\n羁旅虽同白社游，诗书已作青云料。\n蹇质蹉跎竟不成，年过四十尚躬耕。\n长歌达者桮中物，大笑前人身後名。\n幸逢明盛多招隐，高山大泽徵求尽。\n此时亦得辞渔樵，青袍裹身荷圣朝。\n犂牛钓竿不复见，县人邑吏来相邀。\n远路鸣蝉秋兴发，华堂美酒离忧销。\n不知何日更携手，应念兹晨去折腰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}